firebase_admin_dart
Copyright 2018 Razvan Lung (long1eu) and contributors.

This package is an unofficial client of the Firebase Auth admin REST API
(Identity Toolkit), of the IAM Service Account Credentials API and of Google's
OAuth 2.0 token endpoint. It is not a port of a Firebase Admin SDK; its error
codes and some behaviour follow the Firebase Admin SDK for Node.js.

